nce with different properties forms", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "Shape changes", "ok": false, "fb": "Physical."}, {"t": "It melts", "ok": false, "fb": "Physical."}, {"t": "It is cut", "ok": false, "fb": "Physical."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s1p12", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Toasted bread's brown crust is…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "melted bread", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "water", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "a new substance", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "dust", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s1p13", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Chemical reactions happen in our bodies during…", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "blinking only", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "growing hair only", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "sleeping only", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "digestion and respiration", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s1p14", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is dissolving salt in water physical?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "options": [{"t": "Evaporating the water gets the salt back", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "Salt is destroyed", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "A gas forms", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "It burns", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s1p15", "type": "multi", "prompt": "Select ALL chemical changes.", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "Melting", "ok": false, "fb": "Physical."}, {"t": "Dissolving", "ok": false, "fb": "Physical."}, {"t": "Rusting", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "Burning", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "Cooking", "ok": true, "fb": ""}], "hint": "3 statements are correct.", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s1p16", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Freezing is…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "a chemical change", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "combustion", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "rusting", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "a physical change", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s1p17", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Energy for physical changes can be transferred by…", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "only sound", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "only magnets", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "heat, light or electricity", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "nothing", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s1p18", "type": "order", "prompt": "Order the thinking steps to classify a change.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "items": ["Observe the change", "Ask: has a new substance formed?", "If yes → chemical", "If no → physical"], "hint": "", "reason": ""}], "stops": [{"id": "u9v1a", "note": "Paused after: “Physical changes, like freezing and melting, are often easy to reverse. Chemical changes u”", "q": {"id": "u9v1a_q", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Burning a candle is…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "a chemical change", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "a physical change", "ok": false, "fb": "New substances form."}, {"t": "melting only", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "dissolving", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "u9v1b", "note": "Paused after: “Let's practise. Sugar dissolving in hot tea, bread being toasted, an iceberg melting, and ”", "q": {"id": "u9v1b_q", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which is a physical change?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "Bread toasting", "ok": false, "fb": "Chemical."}, {"t": "An iceberg melting", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "Mould growing", "ok": false, "fb": "Chemical."}, {"t": "Wood burning", "ok": false, "fb": "Chemical."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}}]}, {"id": "9.2", "prac": [{"id": "u9s2p01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "The new substances in a reaction are the…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "reactants", "ok": false, "fb": "Starting substances."}, {"t": "indicators", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "products", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "catalysts", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "The arrow in a word equation shows…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "equals", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "heat", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "a gas", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "the direction of the reaction", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Acid + alkali →", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "hydrogen", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "carbon dioxide", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "oxygen", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "salt + water", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p04", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "An oxygen molecule is made of…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "one oxygen atom", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "oxygen and hydrogen", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "two oxygen atoms joined", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "three atoms", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p05", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Iron + sulfur → iron sulfide. The product is…", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "iron", "ok": false, "fb": "Reactant."}, {"t": "sulfur", "ok": false, "fb": "Reactant."}, {"t": "iron and sulfur", "ok": false, "fb": "Reactants."}, {"t": "iron sulfide", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p06", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "One carbon dioxide molecule contains…", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "2 carbon and 1 oxygen", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "1 carbon and 2 oxygen atoms", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "1 carbon, 1 oxygen", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "3 carbon", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p07", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Conservation of mass means…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "mass increases", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "total mass before = total mass after", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "mass is lost", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "mass doesn't matter", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p08", "type": "num", "prompt": "4 g hydrogen + 32 g oxygen → ? g water", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 36, "unit": "g", "tol": 0.0, "units": ["g"], "errs": [], "unitFb": "", "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p09", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Sometimes the warmth of the surroundings is enough to…", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "stop all reactions", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "create atoms", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "destroy mass", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "start a reaction", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p10", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Chalk fizzes in vinegar and the beaker gets lighter because…", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "options": [{"t": "atoms are destroyed", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "chalk evaporates", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "carbon dioxide gas escapes", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "vinegar disappears", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p11", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Hydrogen + oxygen →", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "hydrogen peroxide", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "carbon dioxide", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "ammonia", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "water", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p12", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Carbon + oxygen → carbon dioxide. Reactant or product?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Data", "cols": ["Reactant", "Product"], "rows": [{"l": "Carbon", "a": ["Reactant"]}, {"l": "Oxygen", "a": ["Reactant"]}, {"l": "Carbon dioxide", "a": ["Product"]}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p13", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Magnesium + oxygen → magnesium oxide. Why is the product heavier than the magnesium?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "options": [{"t": "Magnesium grows", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "Mass is created", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "Oxygen atoms from the air have joined it", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "It absorbs heat", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p14", "type": "num", "prompt": "24 g magnesium reacts to make 40 g magnesium oxide. Mass of oxygen used?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 16, "unit": "g", "tol": 0.0, "units": ["g"], "errs": [], "unitFb": "", "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p15", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A word equation uses…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "names of substances", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "pictures only", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "numbers only", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "colours", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p16", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In the particle model, the circles represent…", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "cells", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "bubbles", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "atoms", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "planets", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p17", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Zinc + hydrochloric acid → zinc chloride + ?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "oxygen", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "water", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "hydrogen", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "carbon dioxide", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s2p18", "type": "order", "prompt": "Order what happens in a reaction.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "items": ["Energy is supplied", "Reactant molecules break apart", "Atoms rearrange", "New product molecules form"], "hint": "", "reason": ""}], "stops": [{"id": "u9v2a", "note": "Paused after: “We describe a reaction using a word equation. The starting substances, the reactants, go o”", "q": {"id": "u9v2a_q", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In acid + zinc → zinc chloride + hydrogen, the products are…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "acid and zinc", "ok": false, "fb": "Reactants."}, {"t": "zinc only", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "hydrogen only", "ok": false, "fb": "Both."}, {"t": "zinc chloride and hydrogen", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "u9v2b", "note": "Paused after: “A chemical reaction only rearranges atoms. It can't create or destroy them, or change them”", "q": {"id": "u9v2b_q", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In a reaction, atoms are…", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "destroyed", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "rearranged, not created or destroyed", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "created", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "changed into other elements", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}}]}, {"id": "9.3", "prac": [{"id": "u9s3p01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Burning is also called…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O3", "skill": "Knowledge", "options": [{"t": "corrosion", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "respiration", "ok": false, "fb": "Different."}, {"t": "neutralisation", "ok": false, "fb": "No."}, {"t": "combustion", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}], "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "u9s3p02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which reaction restores oxygen to the air?", "di